# G8: -t (threads) takes the next key as its value.
-- options --
mydumper-version: v0.19.3-3
-- input.cnf --
[mydumper]
routines=-t
outputdir=/backup
-- diagnostics --
2:10-2:12 error MDL408[value-parsed-as-option] `routines` takes no value, so GLib parses `-t` as an option
  = mydumper aborts at startup: "option parsing failed: Cannot parse integer value “--outputdir” for -t, try --help".
